# Shared vendor services used by AI clients.
# Observability intakes. The us5 endpoints are used by Claude Code and Claude
# Desktop; browser-intake-datadoghq.com is the non-regional web intake. These
# must not be process-scoped, or a browser session and its telemetry leave by
# different exits.
DOMAIN,api.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,api.us5.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io

